# Avoid accidentally committing large binaries
*.bin
*.onnx
*.deb
*.run
*.so
*.a
*.isp
*.dfu
*.tflite
*.blob
*.pb
# Point clouds are committed compressed, as <map>/pointcloud_map.pcd.zst, and
# unpacked beside themselves by `just data unpack` (docs/maps.md). The .pcd is
# a build product; never commit it.
*.pcd
*.ply

# Temporary files
*.tmp
